-- a user on a profile outside the default profile's tree
restore user rejected
nothing restored: 0 0
restore user on a descendant: ok, exists 1
-- a settings profile which does not inherit from the default profile
restore profile rejected
nothing restored: 0
-- a chain of profiles restored together with its user
restore chain: ok, exists 1 1 1
user inherits the restored profile:	1
-- without the guard any profile can be restored
restore by an unguarded user: ok, exists 1
